    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: Currently in the process of turning Take the Earth fully 3D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the Earth</strong> is an action conquest open-world game set in the 13th Century. Begin as a captive, fight and conquer other empires until you become world emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse <strong>explorable world</strong> with hidden secrets and mythological legends to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> day and night</strong> cycle which you can use to your benefit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> with customizable gameplay and armies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique top-down movement system that allows for more<strong> in-depth combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse factions</strong> with different combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that are also trying to conquer the world</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: Currently in the process of turning Take the Earth fully 3D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the Earth</strong> is an action conquest open-world game set in the 13th Century. Begin as a captive, fight and conquer other empires until you become world emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse <strong>explorable world</strong> with hidden secrets and mythological legends to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> day and night</strong> cycle which you can use to your benefit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> with customizable gameplay and armies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique top-down movement system that allows for more<strong> in-depth combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse factions</strong> with different combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that are also trying to conquer the world</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take the Earth is an open-world action RPG featuring the whole planet Earth. Uncover mythological legends around the world and use their power to conquer the Earth",
